{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4ea01946-b2fa-8137-8ab8-3409faa763d4",
  "created_at": "2026-02-02T12:36:50-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gerard Reardon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:34:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, Greg speaking. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:34:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Good afternoon. My name is Gerard Reardon. I have a question about a deck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:35:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead. What are you looking to do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:35:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I want to add a deck. Off the back of the house. Do I need a permit? And an inspection?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:35:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, a new deck attached to the house generally needs a building permit, and it gets inspected along the way. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:35:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "349 Bliss Road. By Easton's Beach side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:35:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 349 Bliss Road. Is the deck attached to the house, or free standing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:35:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Attached. To the back door. [pause] Sorry, my nephew is here. He helps me with the English. One moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:35:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:35:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Attached to the back door. Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:35:44-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So that's a deck permit. Now, you'll want to come in with a few things. A simple drawing of the deck, showing the size and how far it sits from the property lines. Details on how it's built, the footings, the lumber, how it connects to the house. And if a contractor is doing it, their license information."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:36:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A drawing. The size. The distance to the line. How it is built. And the contractor paper. Is this right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:36:10-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. If you're building it yourself, just tell us that at the counter. A copy of your deed or a tax bill helps too, to show you own the property."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:36:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The deed. Okay. [pause] Please, you can say the hours?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:36:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We're open Monday through Friday, during regular business hours, at City Hall. You can come in anytime during the day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:36:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Today I go out, I must buy a birthday card and one roll of wrapping paper. Then I come another day with the papers."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:36:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Bring the drawing and the rest whenever you're ready, and we'll go through it with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:36:46-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:36:48-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
